  - a plus with the centre;
  - the full 3×3;
  - the full 3×3 minus the centre;
  - that, also minus the top-middle cell;
  - that, also minus the bottom-middle cell.

Level 4 still looks short by about 3 actions under every mechanic I've found, so either a mechanic remains undiscovered or my model of the level is off somewhere. Whether the large 4×4 player can hit the switch from directly under the passage is still untested. I've added these results to my memory notes.
